{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/Towerdefensennn.png?t=1752426395\" /></div><strong>GRID BASED</strong>\u00a0<strong>PLACEMENT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are able to place dwarfs on the paths and buildings on the sides of paths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNIT LEVELS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dwarfs level up automatically, enemies level up by wave and you need to upgrade your buildings to get more resources\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VILLAGE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to work on the &quot;Dwarven Village&quot; by placing &amp; repairing &amp; upgrading towers to get bonus stats &amp; spells</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GETTING HELP FROM DIFFERENT RACES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you repair the watchtower in the village you are able to select one race and get help from them by being able to place them on paths &amp; being able to place special towers that belongs to that race.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>INCREASE YOUR STATS BY BUYING &amp; UPGRADING TOWERS\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can increase your stats by buying &amp; upgrading towers &amp; statues \u00a0or with cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/Dwarfsnnn.png?t=1752426395\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/Dwarfshow-export.gif?t=1752426395\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u00a0 </i>Dwarfs are base trops\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Ranged &amp; Non-Ranged</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Magical &amp; Non-Magical</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/elfsnnn.png?t=1752426395\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/elfshow-export.gif?t=1752426395\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranged Damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Great Damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No Magical Damage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/granharsnnn.png?t=1752426395\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/granharshow-export.gif?t=1752426395\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Granhars Don't deal that much damage directly instead they put enemies into fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High Magic Resistance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lot's Of Fire Damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/golemsnnn.png?t=1752426395\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/golemsshowEXPORT.gif?t=1752426395\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_